  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 4606.01 Annual Household Goods Carrier Registration",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 4606.01 Annual Household Goods Carrier Registration. Each household goods carrier with an active permit or certificate pursuant to RSA 359-T shall register with the division of motor vehicles each vehicle used in the performance of service as a household goods carrier vehicle annually, pursuant to RSA 359-T:17, RSA 359-T:18, I(b), and Saf-C 505.\n\nSource. #13828, eff 12-22-23 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 4600)\n\nAPPENDIX",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c4600.html"
